{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1463354-the-phoenix-coat-brainstorming-an-artifact","id":1463354,"title":"The Phoenix Coat (brainstorming an Artifact)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-10-10T16:56:02-07:00","id":1463354,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> The Phoenix Coat (brainstorming an Artifact)","content":"So, a new player(!) joined my game(!), and bought three dots' worth (IIRC) of the Artifact Merit. He describes a vibrantly colored coat, that his character won in a knife-throwing contest (Thrown being his character's Supernal). I elaborated on that by describing it as a long coat, covered in multicolored feathers. We settled on one of its most basic powers being the ability to pull off a feather (for one mote), which can then be thrown like a knife (stats of a mortal light thrown weapon, Ex3 p. 587).<br /> <br /> What other Evocations might this coat have? I'm sticking with &quot;fire&quot; and &quot;feathers&quot; themes. A couple of ideas I've had: the ability to glide, moving forward two (or Essence) range bands for every range band fallen, landing safely from any height; an AoE withering attack, in which the wearer spins in a circle and hard-as-steel feathers are flung from the coat; giving the feathers the stats of Artifact light thrown weapons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1856-hakkonen","name":"Hakkonen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}